<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="oc-header">
        <div class="logo"><a href="/swarm" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:contents;cursor:pointer"><h1 class="main-title">OVERCLAW</h1><span class="tagline">AGENT DASHBOARD</span></a></div>
        <div class="header-controls">
            <button id="sidebar-toggle" class="control-button">☰</button>
            <button id="theme-toggle" class="control-button">☀️</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="oc-main-content">
<%- include('partials/sidebar', { currentPath: '/docs' }) %>

        <main class="oc-dashboard-area">
          <style>
            .sw-section { font-size:.7rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#4b5563; padding:.6rem 0 .5rem; border-bottom:1px solid #1f2937; margin-bottom:.75rem; }
            .sw-section:first-of-type { margin-top:0; }
            .doc-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:.75rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem; }
            .doc-card { background:#111827; border:1px solid #1f2937; border-radius:10px; padding:.9rem 1rem; }
            .doc-card h3 { font-size:.82rem; font-weight:700; color:#e2e8f0; margin:0 0 .4rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; }
            .doc-card ul { margin:0; padding-left:1rem; list-style:disc; }
            .doc-card li { font-size:.75rem; color:#6b7280; margin-bottom:.22rem; line-height:1.4; }
            .doc-card li strong { color:#9ca3af; }
            .doc-link { font-size:.75rem; color:#6b7280; display:block; margin-bottom:.2rem; text-decoration:none; }
            .doc-link:hover { color:#e2e8f0; }
            .doc-note { font-size:.72rem; color:#4b5563; font-style:italic; margin-top:.3rem; }
          </style>

          <div class="sw-section">📚 OverClaw Documentation</div>
          <p style="font-size:.8rem;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            OverClaw is the swarm oversight dashboard — it reads the vault (My-AI-Brain) as its source of truth, not any single OpenClaw instance. The nav is organized around the swarm, not the runtime.
          </p>

          <div class="doc-grid">

            <div class="doc-card">
              <h3>🌐 Swarm</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Swarm Overview</strong> — Health of all 4 agents at a glance: task stats, heartbeat dots, 7-day activity heatmap, alerts.</li>
                <li><strong>Task Board</strong> — Vault task board (Inbox → In Progress → Blocked → Done). Click a stat card on the overview to jump to that column.</li>
                <li><strong>Activity Feed</strong> — Live heartbeats and learnings per agent. Filter by agent pill or link from the swarm health cards.</li>
                <li><strong>Vault Graph</strong> — Interactive knowledge graph of the My-AI-Brain Obsidian vault.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-card">
              <h3>🤖 Roster</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Agents</strong> — High-level personas for each swarm agent (Spike, Steve, Lex, Bill): role, runtime type, machine, status. Source: vault Agent Registry.</li>
                <li><strong>Tools & Models</strong> — Per-agent capability cards: model family, tools available, and skill areas. Spike's model is pulled live from OpenClaw config.</li>
                <li><strong>Nodes</strong> — Physical machines in the swarm. Shows OS, IP, assigned agents, and last heartbeat timestamp per machine.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-card">
              <h3>🔁 Operations</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Dashboard</strong> — OverClaw home. Gateway status, version info, and quick links.</li>
                <li><strong>Scheduled Tasks</strong> — All loops, cron jobs, and recurring work across the swarm. Spike's OpenClaw cron jobs are pulled live; other agents' known schedules are listed statically. Filter by agent.</li>
                <li><strong>Sessions</strong> — Active OpenClaw sessions on this instance (Spike's runtime). Shows session list, model, and recent activity.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-card">
              <h3>⚙️ Settings</h3>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Config</strong> — View and audit agent configuration files (SOUL.md, MEMORY.md, AGENTS.md, openclaw.json, model settings).</li>
                <li><strong>Logs</strong> — OpenClaw gateway application logs from this machine.</li>
                <li><strong>Debug</strong> — System diagnostics, API health, and troubleshooting tools for this OverClaw instance.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="sw-section">🔗 External Resources</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <a href="https://docs.openclaw.ai" target="_blank" class="doc-link">📖 OpenClaw Official Docs (docs.openclaw.ai)</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw" target="_blank" class="doc-link">🐙 OpenClaw GitHub (source)</a>
            <a href="/vault/doc?path=03%20-%20Agents/Agent%20Registry.md" class="doc-link">🗂️ Agent Registry (vault)</a>
            <a href="/vault/doc?path=03%20-%20Agents/Coordination/README.md" class="doc-link">📐 Coordination Protocol (vault)</a>
            <a href="/vault/doc?path=08%20-%20QA-and-Monitoring/README.md" class="doc-link">🏥 QA & Monitoring Guide (vault)</a>
          </div>

          <div class="sw-section">🧠 Vault Authority</div>
          <p style="font-size:.78rem;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.5;">
            OverClaw reads <strong style="color:#9ca3af;">My-AI-Brain</strong> (the Obsidian vault at <code style="font-size:.72rem;color:#6366f1;">~/My-AI-Brain</code>) as its source of truth for agents, tasks, heartbeats, learnings, and activity. The vault is synced via git — Spike pulls on every heartbeat, Steve auto-pushes hourly. OverClaw itself does not write to the vault; agents write it, OverClaw reads it.
          </p>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script>
      (function(){
        const sb=document.getElementById('oc-sidebar'),btn=document.getElementById('sidebar-toggle');
        let col=localStorage.getItem('overclaw-sidebar-collapsed')==='true';
        if(col)sb.classList.add('collapsed');
        btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{col=!col;sb.classList.toggle('collapsed',col);localStorage.setItem('overclaw-sidebar-collapsed',col);});
        const th=document.getElementById('theme-toggle');
        let tm=localStorage.getItem('overclaw-theme')||(window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme:dark)').matches?'dark':'light');
        document.body.classList.add(tm+'-mode');th.textContent=tm==='dark'?'🌙':'☀️';
        th.addEventListener('click',()=>{tm=tm==='light'?'dark':'light';document.body.classList.toggle('light-mode',tm==='light');document.body.classList.toggle('dark-mode',tm==='dark');localStorage.setItem('overclaw-theme',tm);th.textContent=tm==='dark'?'🌙':'☀️';});
      })();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
